        },
        "version": {
          "name": "alpha-sapphire",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/26/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les toxines injectées dans son corps quand il s’est fait mordre ont fait de lui un génie. Ses pouvoirs psy ont été grandement amplifiés.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "A poisonous bite reacted with its system, blessing it with the enhanced intellect of a genius. It has full control of its psychic powers.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "噛まれた　毒素の　影響で 天才的　頭脳の　持ち主に。 サイコパワーを　自在に　操る。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il est tellement intelligent qu’il existe un proverbe dans certaines régions qui dit : « Si tu ne sais pas, demande au Roigada. »",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This Pokémon is so famed for its intellect that a proverb still persists in some regions: “When in doubt, ask Slowking.”",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "迷ったら　ヤドキングに聞け　という ことわざが　残る　地域も　あるほど 賢いことで　有名　なのだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il trouve tout le temps des idées formidables qui pourraient changer le monde, mais il les oublie dans la foulée.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It’s constantly coming up with new ideas that would change the world, but as soon as it hits upon a new idea, it forgets it.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "頭の　中では　常に　世界を 変えるような　アイデアが　わきだして いるが　ひらめく端から　忘れる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "On l’appelle « le Grand Sage des mers ». Ses fréquents concours d’intelligence avec Gouroutan se terminent souvent par une égalité.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It’s called “the sage of the sea.” It engages in battles of wits with Oranguru, but the result is usually a draw.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "海の　賢者と　呼ばれる。 ヤレユータンと　知恵比べを　するが 結果は　だいたい　引き分け。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Les toxines du Kokiyas ont imprégné le cerveau du Ramoloss, réveillant en lui une intelligence insoupçonnée, comme par miracle.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Miraculously, this former Slowpoke’s latent intelligence was drawn out when Shellder poison raced through its brain.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "シェルダーの　毒素が　ヤドンの 脳みそを　駆けめぐり　奇跡的に 秘めた　知能を　覚醒させた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il est capable de résoudre tous les problèmes qu’on lui présente, mais personne ne parvient à comprendre ce qu’il dit.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Slowking can solve any problem presented to it, but no one can understand a thing Slowking says.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "尋ねれば　どんな　難題でも 解決してくれるが　ヤドキングの 言葉は　だれも　理解できない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
